abraflexi-revolut (1.2.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Add abraflexi-revolut-statement-downloader package: browser-
    automated Revolut statement download via QR-code login, with
    multi-currency support (one CSV per currency pocket).
  * Fix abraflexi-revolut-csv-import: exit code no longer stays 0 when
    a transaction fails to import, and a missing CSV file no longer
    crashes the script.
  * Update the Revolut statement downloader for Revolut's current
    website: QR-only login, cookie-banner dismissal, working account
    switcher and date-range picker, and drop the webdriver-manager
    pip dependency in favor of the system chromium-driver package.

 -- Vítězslav Dvořák <info@vitexsoftware.cz>  Sat, 05 Sep 2026 17:20:41 +0200

